Package: argon-oneup-suspend
Version: 1.3.4
Architecture: all
Maintainer: GamingTux <gamingtux@users.noreply.github.com>
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/GamingTux/argon-oneup-suite
Depends: rpi-suspend (>= 1.5.0)
Recommends: argon-oneup-lid (>= 1.3.4), argon-oneup-backlight (>= 1.3.4), argon-oneup-battery (>= 1.3.4)
Suggests: rpi-pishutdown (>= 1.3.4)
Description: Argon ONE UP Sleep, Standby & Clamshell Configuration
 Configures and activates the Argon ONE UP laptop hardware profile for rpi-suspend:
  - Selects argon-oneup hardware profile in /etc/rpi-suspend.conf.d/
  - Internal eDP-1 display clamshell blanking & instant resume
  - Keyboard & LED power cut on USB ports 6 & 7 during sleep
  - Preserves TRRS 3.5mm headset combo jack button
  - Enables lid wakeup and low-power sleep hooks
